roke-linejoin=\"round\" role=\"img\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" height=\"18\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"8.5\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"20\" y2=\"14\"></line><line x1=\"23\" y1=\"11\" x2=\"17\" y2=\"11\"></line></svg><svg version=\"1.1\" fill=\"none\" width=\"18\" class=\"svgicon icon_user_check on_unfollow\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" role=\"img\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" height=\"18\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"8.5\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><polyline points=\"17 11 19 13 23 9\"></polyline></svg><span class=\"on_follow\"><span class=\"full_label\">Follow PIZZAPRANKS</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Follow</span></span><span class=\"on_unfollow\"><span class=\"full_label\">Following PIZZAPRANKS</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Following</span></span></a></li><li><a data-game_id=\"4891177\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fpizzapranks.itch.io%2Findiepocalypse-81&amp;intent=add_to_collection\" class=\"action_btn add_to_collection_btn\"><svg version=\"1.1\" fill=\"none\" width=\"18\" class=\"svgicon icon_collection_add2\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" role=\"img\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" height=\"18\"><path d=\"M 1,6 H 14\" /><path d=\"M 1,11 H 14\" /><path d=\"m 1,16 h 9\" /><path d=\"M 18,11 V 21\" /><path d=\"M 13,16 H 23\" /></svg><span class=\"full_label\">Add To Collection</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Collection</span></a></li><li class=\"community_link\"><a href=\"https://pizzapranks.itch.io/indiepocalypse-81#comments\" class=\"action_btn\"><svg version=\"1.1\" fill=\"none\" width=\"18\" class=\"svgicon icon_comment\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" role=\"img\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" height=\"18\"><path d=\"M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\" /></svg>Comments</a></li><li><a href=\"https://itch.io/games-like/4891177/indiepocalypse-81\" target=\"_blank\" data-label=\"related_btn\" class=\"action_btn related_games_btn\"><svg version=\"1.1\" fill=\"none\" width=\"18\" class=\"svgicon icon_map\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" role=\"img\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" height=\"18\"><polygon points=\"1 6 1 22 8 18 16 22 23 18 23 2 16 6 8 2 1 6\"></polygon><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"22\"></line></svg> <span class=\"full_label\">Related games</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Related</span></a></li></ul><script type=\"text/javascript\">new I.GameUserTools('#user_tools')</script><div id=\"wrapper\" class=\"main wrapper game_page_wrapper\"><div id=\"inner_column\" class=\"inner_column size_large family_lato\"><div id=\"header\" class=\"header align_center has_image\"><img alt=\"Indiepocalypse #81\" src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5MjM4NDE0LnBuZw==/original/4pJvAe.png\"/><h1 itemprop=\"name\" class=\"game_title\">Indiepocalypse #81</h1></div><div itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Product\" itemscope id=\"view_game_1639473\" class=\"view_game_page page_widget base_widget buy_on_top\"><div class=\"header_buy_row\"><p>A downloadable game for Windows</p><div class=\"buy_row\"><div class=\"button_message\"><a href=\"https://pizzapranks.itch.io/indiepocalypse-81/purchase\" class=\"button buy_btn\">Buy Now</a><span class=\"buy_message\"><span itemprop=\"price\" class=\"dollars\">$15.00 USD</span> <span class=\"sub\">or more</span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><h1 class=\"text-center\">ISSUE #81</h1>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-center\">Cover -&nbsp;<a href=\"https://whatisaminha.tumblr.com/\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"></a><a href=\"http://www.joysan.ca/\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Joy San</a>&nbsp; - <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/snarkytuna/\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">instagram</a></h1>\r\n<p>Hello and welcome to Indiepocalypse!</p>\r\n<p>Indiepocalypse is a curated monthly collection looking to highlight the very best of the alternative indie game scene.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Each month features games by 10 different developers, including a newly commissioned game exclusive to the bundle-zine. The games cover a wide variety of styles, genres, and themes as they fight against any definition of &quot;indie game&quot; as a genre.</p>\r\n<p>Also, and this part is very important to me and should truly be taken as given, each contributor is paid&nbsp;and developers are paid royalties on all future sales.</p>\r\n<h1><u>This Month&#x27;s Games</u></h1>\r\n<h2 class=\"text-center\">Melancholic Smoking (WIN) by&nbsp;<a href=\"https://nahte101.itch.io/\">Ethan Smith, Arkington Owen</a></h2>\r\n<p>\r\n</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5MjM4MjYwLnBuZw==/original/uM%2Ft5A.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<p>Everything is Me. Smoke Everything<br></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<h2 class=\"text-center\">Food Chain: A Roguelike Zine (Physical) by&nbsp;<a href=\"https://elbuentocino.itch.io/\">Pau Martínez Mayor</a></h2>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5NTEzNDc5LnBuZw==/original/orN6Np.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<p><span></span></p>\r\n<p>A physical roguelike about building houses of cards and battling the beasts that await on each floor. Don&#x27;t let the house crumble or your body perish. Will you ascend the chain and become APEX?</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<p><span></span></p>\r\n<h2 class=\"text-center\">a shroud of rime (WIN/MAC/Linux) by&nbsp;<a href=\"http://vitasun.day\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"></a><a href=\"https://profgoggles.itch.io/\">Joan N.</a><a href=\"http://williamlamkin.com\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"></a></h2>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5NTEzNTMwLnBuZw==/original/d1rSJo.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<p><span></span></p>\r\n<p>What do you do when ICE comes to your neighborhood? Four stories, four potential outcomes.</p>\r\n<h2 class=\"text-center\">Endocardium (WIN) by&nbsp;<a href=\"https://purple-mallow.itch.io/\">Purple Mallow</a></h2>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5NTEzNTM2LnBuZw==/original/6ynO7z.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<p><span></span></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Have you ever woken up in the middle of the night because of a terrible noise? And what if, even when the noise is gone, you still feel that something is missing?</p>\r\n<p>Finding yourself in a surreal world &mdash; be it a visualization of the thought process or a thin plane of reality &mdash; where information noise has become a real one and strange entities roam your home, you must restore the silence and listen to it. Or perhaps to yourself?</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p><span></span></p>\r\n<h2 class=\"text-center\">LOVE alt delete (WIN/MAC/Linux) by&nbsp;<a href=\"https://jacoder23.itch.io\">Jacoder23, celis.tence</a></h2>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5ODg0Mjg0LmdpZg==/original/tLMcmN.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<p>LOVE alt delete is a game about chatbots, their inability to understand people, and our inability to understand them. It&#x27;s a game rife with frustration, misinterpretation, and secrets between people who aren&#x27;t *quite* people.</p>\r\n<p>You are a QA tester assigned to Basel, a chatbot. You are to talk with her and go on &quot;dates&quot; with her by controling Liste, another chatbot, using prompts like &quot;love&quot;, &quot;trash&quot;, and &quot;kill her&quot;. If they coerce you into &quot;freeing&quot; them, do not comply.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<h2 class=\"text-center\">Immaculate Heart (WIN/MAC/Linux) by <a href=\"https://cryocannon.itch.io/\">cryocannon, sikcedel</a></h2>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5ODg0Mjg1LnBuZw==/original/7RSAfI.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\r\n<p>A visual novel about two girls facing divine punishment. Created for Toxic Yuri VN Jam 2.<br></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<h2 class=\"text-center\">CONTROL (WIN/MAC/Linux) by <a href=\"https://fernsensei.itch.io/\">Team Lobster</a></h2>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzMwMDg1MjUwLnBuZw==/original/fqVVBi.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<p>CONTROL was made for the Toxic Yuri VN Jam 2 in less than month and a half. It touches serious themes of trauma and abuse, both physical and psychological, in a dark sci-fi setting.<br></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<h2 class=\"text-center\">Dreamwalkers (Physical) by <a href=\"https://margetheyphone.itch.io/\">Margaret Donohoe (creator/writer) and Kaeden Green (illustrator)</a></h2>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzMwNDcyNDk0LnBuZw==/original/%2BQbJ8I.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<p>Drink some tea, close your eyes, count down from 10, and dive into the Realm of Dreams! In this simple card RPG intended for play at a slumber party, your creativity is the limit. Through cycles of day and night, reveal your inner minds to one another through entities that seep into each others&#x27; subconscious.</p>\r\n<p>Featuring a unique deck of cards (but playable with a standard one), this game is unique yet versatile.</p>\r\n<p><em><br></em><br><br><span></span><br></p>\r\n<h2 class=\"text-center\">*NEWLY COMMISSIONED&nbsp;FOR INDIEPOCALYPSE*</h2>\r\n<h2 class=\"text-center\">Shit City Turmoil (WIN) by&nbsp;<a href=\"https://juice-baby.itch.io/\">Morgan Taylor, Juice Baby</a></h2>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5NTEzNTU0LnBuZw==/original/mxBG%2BI.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<p>A visit to the greatest mall in America. Beautiful life in a shitty city.</p>\r\n<p><span></span></p>\r\n<p><span></span></p>\r\n<p><span></span></p>\r\n<p><span></span></p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<p> <span></span></p>\r\n<p><strong>*BONUS*Electric Zine Maker&nbsp;</strong>(WIN/MAC) by&nbsp;<a href=\"https://alienmelon.itch.io/\">alienmelon</a><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzQyMDQxOTQuZ2lm/original/CjpfbI.gif\" style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<h5>Launcher Courtesy of&nbsp;<a href=\"https://ash-k.itch.io/mm-bundle-launcher\">MM Bundle Launcher</a></h5>\r\n<table><tbody></tbody></table>\r\n<p>Interested in the Indiepocalypse being delivered straight to you every month? Sign up for the&nbsp;<a href=\"http://indiepocalypse.com/patreon\" style=\"font-size: inherit\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong>PATREON</strong></a>.</p>\r\n<p>If you are interested in contributing to Indiepocalypse check out the submission page:</p>\r\n<p><strong><a href=\"http://indiepocalypse.com/submit\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">SUBMIT YOUR GAME TO THE INDIEPOCALYPSE</a></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><a href=\"http://indiepocalypse.com/radio\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">TUNE INTO INDIEPOCALYPSE RADIO, SATURDAYS 2pm EST</a></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://twitter.com/PIZZAPRANKS\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">FOLLOW INDIEPOCALYPSE ON TWITTER</a></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><a href=\"http://indiepocalypse.com/newsletter\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">SIGN UP FOR THE NEWSLETTER</a>&nbsp;</strong>(and get free copies of the PDFs!)</p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<p><u><strong><a href=\"http://indiepocalypse.com/\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">THE FULL INDIEPOCALYPSE CATALOG</a></strong></u></p>\r\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/hPR423a\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">DISCORD</a></strong></p>\r\n<p><u><strong><a href=\"http://indiepocalypse.com/ad\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"></a></strong></u><u><strong><span></span></strong></u></p>\r\n<p>(interested in these games by find the price too high or just unappealing? follow the link&#x27;s to each dev&#x27;s page where the games are often cheaper (if not free). while it&#x27;s nice when people get paid, the games being played is the most important part (you can also just pay individual dev if you want and should))</p></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" class=\"toggle_info_btn\">More information<svg height=\"6\" width=\"12\" version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\" role=\"img\" viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\" aria-hidden><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z\"/></svg></a></div><div class=\"info_panel_wrapper\"><div id=\"game_info_panel_6063189\" class=\"game_info_panel_widget base_widget\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Updated</td><td><abbr title=\"06 October 2026 @ 00:01 UTC\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-stopwatch\"></span> 18 hours ago</abbr></td></tr><tr><td>Published</td><td><abbr title=\"02 October 2026 @ 17:01 UTC\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-stopwatch\"></span> 4 days ago</abbr></td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/released\">Released</a></td></tr><tr><td>Platforms</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/platform-windows\">Windows</a></td></tr><tr><td>Rating</td><td><div data-tooltip=\"5.00 average rating from 1 total ratings\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"aggregate_rating\" itemprop=\"aggr